hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16837","Abd Allah narrated to us, Nadr ibn Ali al-Jahdami and Abd al-A'la ibn Hammad Abu Yahya al-Narsi narrated to us, they said: Amir ibn Abi Amir al-Khazzaz narrated to us, he said: Ayyub ibn Musa narrated to us from his father from his grandfather, he said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: No father grants a child a gift better than good manners."
